                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">FEM / PLATE WITH HOLE
Full-solid domain, no optimization. Holes remain empty.
Illustrative mm/N inputs: E=210000 N/mm^2, nu=0.3, t=2 mm; default total load 0.001 N downward.
Replace these values with your actual material and loading. Point loads can create stress peaks.</item>
